<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Entropy-Aware On-Policy Distillation of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Tradeoff Between Cumulative Probability Mass and Memory in Top-<math class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> Truncation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Entropy-Aware On-Policy Distillation of Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Results on the Llama Model</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
