Comparison with different forward KL placement strategies for the Qwen3-1.7B-Base student. EOPD shows competitive performance against full and random forward KL, while random forward KL underperforms the other two approaches. <span id="S5.T6.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> indicates the best performance and <span id="S5.T6.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underline</span> indicates second-best.
